#: templates/about.html:18
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Paulina invites you to learn about the cultural heritage of humanity. It "
"is a multilingual tool, powered by %(wikidata_link)s, that allows you to "
"search for people and find out if they have freely accessible works in "
"the public domain. It also facilitates the understanding of copyright "
"terms and helps to know when a work enters the public domain in each "
"country."
msgstr ""
"Paulina invitate conocer el padremuñu cultural de la humanidá. Ye una "
"ferramienta multillingüe, impulsada por %(wikidata_link)s, que te permite"
" guetar persones y saber si tienen obres d'accesu llibre nel dominiu "
"públicu. Tamién facilita la comprensión de los plazos de copyright y aida"
" saber cuándo una obra entra nel dominiu públicu en cada país."

#: templates/about.html:20
msgid ""
"Paulina is fed by data from Wikidata, the free and collaborative database"
" maintained by the Wikimedia Foundation."
msgstr ""
"Paulina aliméntase de datos dende Wikidata, la base de datos llibre y "
"collaborativa mantenida pola Fundación Wikimedia."

#: templates/about.html:21
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the information consulted may contain errors or be incomplete."
" Paulina helps to identify gaps and inaccuracies in information about "
"cultural heritage and invites you to improve the data in Wikidata and, "
"through it, on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Dacuando, la información consultada pue tener errores o tar incompleta. "
"Paulina aida identificar llacunes ya inexactitudes na información sobre'l"
" padremuñu cultural ya invita a ameyorar los datos en Wikidata y, al "
"traviés d'ella, na Internet."

#: templates/about.html:22
msgid "Local tools"
msgstr "Ferramientes llocales"

#: templates/about.html:23
msgid ""
"This website is part of a larger project to facilitate the creation of "
"national, regional or thematic versions of the tool, according to the "
"needs of each community."
msgstr ""
"Esta páxina web forma parte d'un proyeutu más ampliu pa facilitar la "
"creación de versiones nacionales, rexonales o temátiques de la "
"ferramienta, según les necesidaes de cada comunidá."

#: templates/about.html:24
msgid "Who makes Paulina"
msgstr "Quiénes creamos Paulina"

#: templates/about.html:25
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Paulina is supported by %(artica_link)s, %(cc_uruguay_link)s, "
"%(data_uruguay_link)s and %(wm_uruguay_link)s."
msgstr ""
"Paulina cuenta col sofitu de %(artica_link)s, %(cc_uruguay_link)s, "
"%(data_uruguay_link)s y %(wm_uruguay_link)s."

#: templates/about.html:26
msgid "Content licenses"
msgstr "Llicencias de los conteníos"

#: templates/about.html:27
#, python-format
msgid ""
"All data in the pages about authors, works, countries and terms come from"
" Wikidata and are under the terms of the %(CC0_link)s."
msgstr ""
"Tolos datos nes páxines sobro autores, obres, países y plazos vienen de "
"Wikidata y tán so los términos de %(CC0_link)s."

#: templates/about.html:28
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The texts and other original content of this website are under a "
"%(ccbysa_link)s."
msgstr ""
"Los testos y demás conteníu orixinal d'esta páxina web tán so una "
"%(ccbysa_link)s."

#: templates/about.html:29
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The images and media in the pages about authors, works, countries and "
"terms come from %(wm_commons_link)s and are under different free licenses"
" or in the public domain. We recommend consulting the information of each"
" content on Wikimedia Commons."
msgstr ""
"Les imáxenes y medios nes páxines sobre autores, obres, países y plazos "
"vienen de %(wm_commons_link)s y tán so distintes llicencies llibres o nel"
" dominiu públicu. Recomendamos consultar la información de cada conteníu "
"en Wikimedia Commons."

#: templates/about.html:30
msgid ""
"The works accessible through links to external sites are available to the"
" public, mostly because they are in the public domain, or under free "
"licenses, but some of them may be under copyright in some jurisdictions. "
"We recommend consulting the information of each work on the websites "
"where they are hosted."
msgstr ""
"Les obres accesibles al traviés d'enllaces a sitios esternos tán "
"disponibles al públicu, mayormente porque tán nel dominiu públicu o so "
"llicencies llibres, pero dalgunes d'elles podrían tar so copyright en "
"dalgunes xurisdiciones. Recomendamos consultar la información de caúna "
"les obres nos sitios webs onde tán albergáes."

#: templates/about.html:31
msgid "Free software"
msgstr "Software llibre"

#: templates/about.html:32
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Paulina is free software. It is published under the %(agpl_link)s. Visit "
"the %(repository_link)s."
msgstr ""
"Paulina ye software llibre. Ta asoleyada so la %(agpl_link)s. Visita'l "
"%(repository_link)s."

